The function coherently integrates both operations into a single cohesive unit, executing them sequentially with the Union-Find operations conducted after all NFAPI_CRC_INDICATION_PDU_T structures have been successfully created. The code is designed to handle potential system dependencies and ensure compatibility with existing infrastructure, while also considering the impact of concurrent access to shared resources and minimizing contention.']

