The NetworkDeviceMetrics structure contains deviceID, a vector of dataTransferVolumes in megabytes, and a calculated utilizationPercentage. The NetworkDevices class enforces a total data transfer volume limit per device and computes the utilization percentage based on historical traffic patterns. It also serialize these structures into a .csv file format for later retrieval and analysis.']

